---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Contact Us" description="Contact Social Security Bronx with feedback, corrections, or questions about the site.">
  <div class="container article">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p class="lead">Have a correction, suggestion, or question about the site? We want to hear it.</p>
    <h2>Important note</h2>
    <p>Social Security Bronx is NOT the Social Security Administration. We cannot help with your individual Social Security account, applications, benefits, or any official transactions. For those, you must contact the SSA directly:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>SSA national line:</strong> 1-800-772-1213 (TTY 1-800-325-0778)</li>
      <li><strong>Online:</strong> <a href="https://www.ssa.gov">ssa.gov</a></li>
      <li><strong>the Bronx SSA office:</strong> 820 Concourse Village West, Bronx, NY 10451</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Site feedback</h2>
    <p>For corrections, suggestions, or questions about this website only, reach us at: <strong>hello@socialsecuritybronx.com</strong></p>
    <p>Please do not send personal information such as your Social Security number. We cannot help with individual SSA matters and any such information will be deleted unread.</p>
  </div>
</Base>


<style>
  .article-page { padding: var(--space-7) 0 var(--space-8); }
  .article-page header { margin-bottom: var(--space-6); padding-bottom: var(--space-5); border-bottom: var(--border-w) solid var(--color-ink); }
  .article-page h1 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3rem); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); letter-spacing: -0.025em; }
  .article-page .lead { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.55; color: var(--color-text-muted); }
  .article-page .body { font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .article-page .body h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.4rem; margin-top: var(--space-6); margin-bottom: var(--space-3); padding-bottom: var(--space-2); border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--color-ink); }
  .article-page .body p { margin-bottom: var(--space-4); }
  .article-page .body a { color: var(--color-primary); text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
  .article-page .body ul { padding-left: var(--space-5); }
  .article-page .body li { margin-bottom: var(--space-2); }
  .article-page .eyebrow-row { display: flex; gap: var(--space-3); margin-bottom: var(--space-4); flex-wrap: wrap; }
</style>

